  - title: 04 / Recover a feedback fault
    explanation: Disconnect W16 and confirm the storage relay opens. Reconnect, reset,
      calibrate and repeat regeneration.
    caption: "W16  \u2022  CAPACITOR VOLTAGE"
    parts:
    - id: input
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.18, y: 0.56}
